  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "### **Turn Your Flowchart Into Code**\r\n\r\n#### **Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. **Plan:** Import your flowchart sketch from your Backpack. In `prompt.md`, write a prompt that asks AI to turn your flowchart into JavaScript.\r\n\r\n2. **Build:** Use AI to generate the code.\r\n\r\n3. **Test:** Try different values and check that your code works correctly.\r\n\r\n4. **Evaluate:** Compare the AI's code to your flowchart. Ask yourself:\r\n   * Does the condition match what you drew in the diamond?\r\n   * Does the `if` path show the right outcome?\r\n   * Does the `else` path show the right outcome?\r\n   * Did the AI miss anything or add something you didn't plan for?\r\n\r\n5. Optional: Prompt AI to update the HTML and/or CSS to match your specific code, e.g. mute and unmute buttons.",
